<img alt="Social Proof" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors cursor-zoom-in hidden md:block" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC_UwuhtMye2KC7A-SarQ-kbAfosRkAg-BXae5LbmSZvmUHoZRF6Q_aBC5dfBc8_JU_LAg-vr5lkHfQkx3jadEsEQHs_WztoryIulMqxkUe8lzX8itUd0vjfvmdL9jG4U0BfhwQHE96JBHCgR94HdzdkpaP8jTVQjHbRHP2mfbcPnCQmPDtqhaCX4bxbA-lIZ0t0RnIEEMUx4-hQmYfEwIZsHlS2DbhgI7iPyzAztcojsYV24WfBSoblg">
</div>
<!-- CTA & Ribbon -->
<div class="text-center bg-surface-container rounded-3xl p-8 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/5 via-transparent to-primary/5"></div>
<p class="text-primary font-bold mb-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-lg relative z-10">
<span class="tracking-widest">★★★★★</span>
                Centenas de profissionais já estão aplicando o Método Maestro.
            </p>
<button class="relative z-10 w-full sm:w-auto bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest py-5 px-10 rounded-full font-extrabold shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(212,175,55,0.5)] transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 active:translate-y-0 active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mx-auto text-base">
                QUERO FAZER PARTE DA PRÓXIMA TURMA
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">arrow_forward</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section class="py-xl px-5 bg-[#080808] relative border-t border-white/5 overflow-hidden">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal-on-scroll visible">
<div class="text-center mb-16">
<h2 class="font-display-lg-mobile md:font-display-lg text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg font-bold tracking-tighter mb-4 text-white">Ainda ficou alguma dúvida?</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl mx-auto">Respondemos abaixo as perguntas mais comuns antes da compra do bilhete para que você tome sua decisão com total clareza.</p>
</div>
<!-- Accordion Items -->
<div class="space-y-6">
<!-- Q1 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    O que é o Método Maestro?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    O Método Maestro é a mentoria presencial definitiva focada em alavancar a carreira de Personal Trainers, ensinando estratégias de posicionamento, vendas de alto valor e construção de autoridade no mercado premium.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q2 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Como funciona a mentoria?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    A mentoria é uma imersão completa com aulas teóricas e práticas, análise de casos, e networking qualificado. Você terá um mapa claro do que executar para escalar seus resultados logo após o evento.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q3 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    A mentoria é presencial ou online?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    A experiência principal é presencial, projetada para gerar conexão e networking de alto nível. Porém, disponibilizamos acesso a materiais de apoio online na nossa plataforma exclusiva.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q4 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Qual a duração do evento?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    O evento tem duração de 2 dias intensos (sábado e domingo), das 09h às 19h, com intervalos estratégicos para refeições e networking.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q5 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Receberei certificado?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Sim, todos os participantes que concluírem a mentoria receberão um certificado de conclusão com carga horária reconhecida.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q6 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Terei acesso aos materiais?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Com certeza. Você terá acesso à nossa área de membros com materiais complementares, templates, planilhas e o PDF das aulas ministradas.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q7 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Os bônus estão inclusos?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Sim, todos os bônus descritos na oferta oficial são destravados imediatamente ou entregues presencialmente conforme as regras da turma.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q8 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Posso parcelar?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Sim, o pagamento pode ser parcelado em até 12x no cartão de crédito, com as taxas da plataforma informadas no checkout.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q9 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Quais formas de pagamento são aceitas?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Aceitamos Cartão de Crédito, PIX e Boleto Bancário (apenas à vista para boleto).
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q10 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Como funciona o lote atual?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    As vendas funcionam por lotes com quantidades limitadas de ingressos. Assim que um lote esgota, o próximo é iniciado automaticamente com o valor reajustado.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q11 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    O valor aumenta quando virar o lote?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Sim. Recomendamos fortemente garantir seu bilhete no lote atual para aproveitar as melhores condições financeiras, pois não garantimos manutenção do preço.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q12 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Posso transferir meu ingresso?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    A transferência de titularidade é permitida até 7 dias antes do evento, devendo ser solicitada e validada junto ao nosso suporte oficial.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q13 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Existe política de cancelamento?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Sim, respeitamos o Código de Defesa do Consumidor e oferecemos garantia incondicional de 7 dias após a compra para devolução integral do valor investido.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q14 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Como receberei meu ingresso?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Após a aprovação do pagamento, você receberá um e-mail com todas as instruções e o QR Code que servirá como seu bilhete de acesso ao evento.
                </div>
</div>
<!-- Q15 -->
<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-0">
<button class="accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left py-2 hover:text-primary transition-colors text-white text-lg font-semibold outline-none group">
                    Como entro no grupo exclusivo?
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white/50 group-hover:text-primary transition-transform duration-300">add</span>
</button>
<div class="accordion-content text-on-surface-variant mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed pb-4">
                    Dentro da plataforma onde o seu ingresso é hospedado, haverá um link oficial para ingressar no nosso grupo silencioso de avisos no WhatsApp.
                </div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Help Block -->
<div class="mt-16 glass-card rounded-3xl p-10 text-center border-primary/20 gold-glow relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary/10 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="relative z-10">
<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-surface-container rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 border border-white/10">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl">support_agent</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold mb-3 text-white">Ainda precisa de ajuda?</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-8 text-lg">Nossa equipe está pronta para esclarecer qualquer dúvida antes da sua inscrição.</p>
<button class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#25D366] text-white font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest py-4 px-8 rounded-full font-bold shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(37,211,102,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(37,211,102,0.5)] transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 active:translate-y-0 active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mx-auto text-base">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">chat</span>
                    FALAR COM A EQUIPE
                </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- 16. Final CTA -->
<section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-5 py-xl bg-[#050505] relative border-t border-primary/20 overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-40 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary/10 via-black to-black pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center reveal-on-scroll visible">
<div class="w-40 h-40 mx-auto rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-8 border-4 border-primary/30 gold-glow">
<img alt="Filipe Aquino" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBuuudjj-DSORWv4XLEB8sCaOJPZ194uKPeoIJ-Osi1wEGvb9PbJPrcAhjy3vC5YE5dmT0KUkQHoLZnH1U0d_7DXSVGPoV_Sn3qswWTJ-0INPBi4a0rEZjW5TJ-siI4UrPFbqGTjLf2KvDqvO4Jva4C44w_bxDSWTH0cnvxuWW52D58UouTuvlM64YUVuKkeFm1Demb_R8ttVv_Oyos-K2iv9p5ZMdAPU8kGFERrqoiZg8zeLxJDUBixQ">
</div>
<h2 class="font-display-lg md:font-display-xl text-display-lg md:text-display-xl font-bold tracking-tighter mb-6 text-white">
                A HORA DA VIRADA É <span class="text-primary">AGORA</span>.
            </h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-12 max-w-xl mx-auto">
                Deixe de ser apenas mais um no mercado e junte-se à elite dos Personal Trainers. As vagas são limitadíssimas e o próximo lote terá um reajuste agressivo.
            </p>
<button class="w-full md:w-auto bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest py-6 px-12 rounded-full font-extrabold shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(212,175,55,0.4)] hover:shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(212,175,55,0.6)] transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-2 active:translate-y-0 active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-lg">
                GARANTIR MINHA VAGA IMEDIATAMENTE
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">rocket_launch</span>
</button>
<p class="mt-6 text-on-surface-variant text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-green-500">lock</span> Compra 100% Segura e Garantida
            </p>
</div>
</section>
</main>
<!-- BottomNavBar -->
<nav class="md:hidden fixed bottom-0 w-full z-50 rounded-t-xl bg-background/80 backdrop-blur-lg border-t border-primary/20 shadow-[0_-10px_40px_rgba(212,175,55,0.15)] flex justify-around items-center h-24 px-md pb-safe">
<button class="bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-full px-6 py-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(212,175,55,0.3)] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 animate-pulse-subtle w-full max-w-[200px]">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">confirmation_number</span>
<span class="">Garantir Meu Bilhete</span>
</button>
<button class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">support_agent</span>
<span class="">Suporte</span>
</button>
